    "scenesThatPass": [
      "YVONNE: C'mon, honey!\nALICE: I'm the A-L-I-C-E. Blond hair on my head, blue eyes to see.",
      "GRETA: Maybe I should spell it for you.\nALICE: Maybe God's trying to tell you something.",
      "GRETA: That must never pass these lips.\nRACINE GIBSON: Greta, that's not what a cover girl puts in her body.",
      "GRETA: Pimples, heartburn, cellulite... and no modeling career.\nALICE: Not to mention the heartbreak of psoriasis.",
      "YVONNE: All right kids, I tell you what we're gonna do. I've got swimming practice until six-thirty today...\nGRETA: Yeah...\nYVONNE: That means they're gonna give me the key to the pool so I can lock up when I'm done."
    ]
